gle<!-- -->]</button><button class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b-2 font-bold uppercase transition-all tracking-wider border-transparent text-[#8A8F87] hover:text-white\">[<!-- -->NVIDIA<!-- -->]</button><button class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b-2 font-bold uppercase transition-all tracking-wider border-transparent text-[#8A8F87] hover:text-white\">[<!-- -->DeepSeek<!-- -->]</button><button class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b-2 font-bold uppercase transition-all tracking-wider border-transparent text-[#8A8F87] hover:text-white\">[<!-- -->Mistral<!-- -->]</button><button class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b-2 font-bold uppercase transition-all tracking-wider border-transparent text-[#8A8F87] hover:text-white\">[<!-- -->Groq<!-- -->]</button><button class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b-2 font-bold uppercase transition-all tracking-wider border-transparent text-[#8A8F87] hover:text-white\">[<!-- -->Cohere<!-- -->]</button><button class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b-2 font-bold uppercase transition-all tracking-wider border-transparent text-[#8A8F87] hover:text-white\">[<!-- -->Replicate<!-- -->]</button><button class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b-2 font-bold uppercase transition-all tracking-wider border-transparent text-[#8A8F87] hover:text-white\">[<!-- -->Others<!-- -->]</button></div></div><div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-20 font-mono text-xs text-[#8FBF3F]\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border border-[#212623] bg-[#131615]/80 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg shadow-xl shadow-black/40 select-none\"><span>&gt; <!-- -->loading_api_index</span><span class=\"text-[#8FBF3F] font-bold\">[ ▖ ]</span></div></div><div class=\"mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-slate-800/60 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 text-xs font-mono text-slate-500\"><p>Index check: <!-- -->35<!-- --> active api endpoints listed.</p><div class=\"flex gap-4\"><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/api/v1/tools\">[raw_tools_json]</a><span>|</span><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/api/v1/categories\">[raw_categories_json]</a></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"border-t border-[#212623] bg-[#0A0C0B] py-12 text-[#8A8F87]\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"md:col-span-2\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono text-sm font-bold tracking-tight text-white mb-4\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"text-[#8FBF3F]\">&gt;</span><span>crawlers //</span></a><p class=\"text-xs leading-5 max-w-xs text-[#8A8F87] font-sans\">Discover AI bots and command utilities organized strictly by the job to be done. We index, verify, and link directly to external creators.</p></div><div><h3 class=\"text-xs font-sans font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white mb-4\">Index Sections</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-xs font-mono\"><li><a class=\"hover:text-[#8FBF3F] transition-colors\" href=\"/category/general-reasoning\">/<!-- -->general-reasoning</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-[#8FBF3F] transition-colors\" href=\"/category/developer-tools\">/<!-- -->developer-tools</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-[#8FBF3F] transition-colors\" href=\"/category/search-research\">/<!-- -->search-research</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-[#8FBF3F] transition-colors\" href=\"/category/creative-media\">/<!-- -->creative-media</a></li><li><a class=\"text-[#8FBF3F] hover:underline font-sans font-bold text-xs\" href=\"/\">All Categories →</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class=\"text-xs font-sans font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white mb-4\">Compliance</h3><p class=\"text-[10px] leading-relaxed text-[#8A8F87]/80 font-sans\">We built Crawlers to catalog AI tools by use case. Our crawler searches Product Hunt and GitHub feeds, checks robots.txt to respect site policies, and paraphrases marketing copy in our own words to avoid copyright issues. We don&#x27;t embed or iframe external tools — we link you straight to the source.</p></div></div><div clas